# The orchestrator protocol is the one document that stays private. `*.md` was
# doing that job, but it also hid docs/, SUBMISSION.md and state/STATE.md —
# every one of which README links to, so all nine links 404'd for anyone who
# cloned the repo. Name the private file instead of the whole file type.
*.md
!README.md
